B.qf=s(["\u06cc\u06a9\u0634\u0646\u0628\u0647","\u062f\u0648\u0634\u0646\u0628\u0647","\u0633\u0647\u200c\u0634\u0646\u0628\u0647","\u0686\u0647\u0627\u0631\u0634\u0646\u0628\u0647","\u067e\u0646\u062c\u0634\u0646\u0628\u0647","\u062c\u0645\u0639\u0647","\u0634\u0646\u0628\u0647"],t.s)
B.b89=s(["Great choice! Are you working on anything interesting today, or just taking a relaxing break?","That sounds lovely. Do you usually come to caf\xe9s to read or focus, or do you prefer studying at home?","I know what you mean! What are your plans for the rest of the evening?"],t.s)
B.beX=s(["Hi! Could I have a green tea and a croissant, please? My morning has been busy but good.","Good morning! I'd like a coffee, please. Today I'm taking a short break from my studies.","Hey! A bottle of water would be great, thanks. So far my day is going really well."],t.s)
B.amE=new A.o5("cafe","Caf\xe9 & Rencontre","A1\u2013A2","Hey! Welcome in \u2014 it's quite busy this morning, isn't it? What can I get for you, and how has your day been so far?","Salut ! Bienvenue \u2014 il y a du monde ce matin, n\u2019est-ce pas ? Que puis-je vous servir, et comment se passe votre journ\xe9e jusqu\u2019ici ?",B.b89,B.beX)
B.bbu=s(["That sounds really productive! What part of your day do you enjoy the most?","Interesting! How do you usually unwind and recharge when you have some free time?","If you could pick up one new habit this month, what would it be and why?"],t.s)
B.bd5=s(["My week has been pretty busy! I've been focusing on my studies and practising English every day.","It's going well, thanks! This morning I worked on a project and now I'm taking a break.","Pretty good so far! I'm trying to stay disciplined with my morning routine."],t.s)
B.amF=new A.o5("daily_life","Ta journ\xe9e","A1\u2013B1","Hey! Good to talk to you today. How's your week going so far \u2014 have you been busy with work, studies, or personal projects?","Salut ! Ravi de te parler aujourd\u2019hui. Comment se passe ta semaine jusqu\u2019ici \u2014 occup\xe9 par le travail, les \xe9tudes ou des projets personnels ?",B.bbu,B.bd5)
B.be6=s(["Glad to hear that! Are you here for work, a conference, or just exploring for a few days?","By the way, would you like any recommendations for good places to eat or visit nearby?","Everything is set for your room! Is there anything else I can help you arrange for tomorrow?"],t.s)
B.baO=s(["Thank you! The flight was smooth, and yes, it's my very first time visiting this city.","Good afternoon! I had a long trip, so I'm excited to check in and get some rest.","Thanks! I'm here for three nights to attend a conference and explore the neighbourhood."],t.s)
B.amD=new A.o5("travel","Voyage & H\xf4tel","A2\u2013B1","Good afternoon and welcome to the hotel! Did you have a smooth trip getting here, and is this your first time visiting the city?","Bonjour et bienvenue \xe0 l\u2019h\xf4tel ! Avez-vous fait bon voyage, et est-ce votre premi\xe8re visite dans cette ville ?",B.be6,B.baO)
B.beS=s(["That's impressive. Tell me about a tricky obstacle you ran into on a project \u2014 how did you figure out a solution?","Good perspective. What would a colleague say is your biggest strength, and what skill are you actively sharpening right now?","Before we wrap up, what kind of impact do you hope to make in your next role?"],t.s)
B.ba5=s(["Thank you for having me! I have a background in engineering, and recently I led a project that cut delays by 30 percent.","Good morning! I'm a dedicated student who enjoys solving practical problems with a team.","One achievement I'm proud of is organizing a complex deliverable ahead of deadline despite tight constraints."],t.s)
B.amH=new A.o5("interview","Entretien pro","B1\u2013B2","Good morning, thanks for making time to speak with me today! To start off, could you walk me through your background and share one achievement you're genuinely proud of?","Bonjour, merci d\u2019avoir pris le temps de nous parler aujourd\u2019hui ! Pour commencer, pouvez-vous pr\xe9senter votre parcours et une r\xe9alisation dont vous \xeates fier ?",B.beS,B.ba5)
B.b7Y=s(["That makes a lot of sense. Who benefits the most from it, and what makes your approach stand out?","Every ambitious project hits roadblocks \u2014 what's the toughest challenge you're tackling right now?","If you had 30 seconds to pitch this to a partner, how would you sum up its main value?"],t.s)
B.baF=s(["We're building a practical tool that helps students learn faster even with limited internet access.","My project focuses on reducing waste in agriculture by tracking soil moisture in real time.","So far we finished the prototype, and now we're gathering honest feedback from early users."],t.s)
B.amB=new A.o5("work_project","Projet & Travail","B2\u2013C1","Hey, glad we finally caught up! I heard you've been working on an interesting project lately. What problem are you trying to solve, and how is it going so far?","Salut, content qu\u2019on prenne enfin le temps d\u2019\xe9changer ! J\u2019ai entendu dire que tu travailles sur un projet int\xe9ressant. Quel probl\xe8me cherches-tu \xe0 r\xe9soudre et o\xf9 en es-tu ?",B.b7Y,B.baF)
B.b5u=s(["Fair point! Though what would you say to someone who argues that instant answers reduce deep reading?","That's a strong nuance. Have you noticed that shift in your own work or studies?","So if you had to set one golden rule for using AI wisely, what would it be?"],t.s)
B.b5I=s(["In my view, it depends on how we use it: AI accelerates research, provided that we still verify every claim.","Although AI saves huge amounts of time, relying on it blindly can definitely weaken critical thinking.","On balance, I see it as a great sparring partner \u2014 as long as humans stay responsible for the final judgment."],t.s)
B.amC=new A.o5("debate","D\xe9bat d\u2019id\xe9es","B2\u2013C2","I was reading something thought-provoking earlier and wanted your honest take: do you think artificial intelligence is making us sharper thinkers, or quietly making us lazier?","Je lisais un article stimulant tout \xe0 l\u2019heure et je voulais ton avis sinc\xe8re : penses-tu que l\u2019intelligence artificielle rend notre pens\xe9e plus aff\xfbt\xe9e, ou plus paresseuse ?",B.b5u,B.b5I)
B.bdK=s(["Tell me more about that! What made it stand out for you?","That's really interesting \u2014 how did you feel about it?","What's your next step or goal on that front?"],t.s)
B.bdl=s(["Hey Amy! Today I want to talk about my daily routine and practise speaking more naturally.","Hi! I'm preparing for my career goals and I'd love to discuss them in English.","Honestly, I just want a casual conversation about books, learning, and technology."],t.s)
B.amG=new A.o5("free","Discussion libre","A1\u2013C2","Hey! Really nice to chat with you. What's on your mind today \u2014 anything interesting going on in your week that you'd like to talk about in English?","Salut ! Ravi de discuter avec toi. Qu\u2019est-ce qui te passe par la t\xeate aujourd\u2019hui \u2014 quelque chose d\u2019int\xe9ressant dans ta semaine dont tu aimerais parler en anglais ?",B.bdK,B.bdl)
B.qg=s([B.amE,B.amF,B.amD,B.amH,B.amB,B.amC,B.amG],A.F("w<o5>"))
