B.amq=new A.e5("a1_1","A1",1,"Se pr\xe9senter sans calques du fran\xe7ais","\xc2ge, profession, accord (\xab To Be \xbb vs \xab To Have \xbb)",5,B.be3,B.bd0,B.b5c,B.bdN,"Let's practise introducing yourself naturally! Hi, I'm Amy \u2014 tell me your name, your age or background, and what you do!","Mise en pratique de la le\xe7on A1.1 : pr\xe9sentez-vous avec \xab I am... \xbb, votre m\xe9tier/\xe9tudes et votre \xe2ge.",!1)
